## Not driven (environment blockers)
- Camera capture: the rear viewfinder returns an all-black frame and the front viewfinder a near-black scene
  (r3-device-camera-viewfinder.png, r3-device-camera-front-viewfinder.png); the captured frame then fails the photo
  quality gate ("The image has low contrast"), so no camera-originated photo can be scored in this physical setup.
- The non-sugarcane rejection used a synthetic high-contrast image, not a photograph of a non-sugarcane plant, because
  no such photograph exists in the repository and the camera is unusable.
